{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-offer-content-personalization","title":"动态优惠与个性化内容/商品推荐决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/incentive-content-decision/dynamic-offer-content-personalization","wordCount":2989,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态优惠与个性化内容-商品推荐决策\">动态优惠与个性化内容/商品推荐决策</h1><p>把优惠券当成「全局 10% 折扣」发出去，跨境挽回的毛利率会被两类用户吃掉：本来就会自己回来下单的人白拿折扣，而被折扣养刁的人从此不再原价购买。挽回旅程的第三步究竟推「免运费」「限时 15%」还是「同款低价替代品」，本质上是一次<strong>在用户上下文里的条件决策</strong>：在候选动作集合上对「增量利润」而非「转化率」排序，同时受预算、频次与合规约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把优惠视为决策变量而非内容模板\">核心概念：把优惠视为决策变量而非内容模板</h2><p>固定阶梯（第 1 封提醒、第 2 封免运费、第 3 封 15%）把「发什么内容」「发多大面额」「发几档」三个纠缠的问题拆开回答了。动态决策把它们合并成一个动作空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>：提醒、免运费、5%/10%/15% 折扣、定向码、替代品推荐、捆绑，每个动作同时描述「货品内容」与「价格让步」。对每个动作，引擎估计它在<strong>当前上下文</strong>下的期望增量利润而非期望转化率；增量利润必须先扣掉基线，即「什么都不发」时该用户也会产生的利润：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Pi(a \\mid x) = \\hat{p}(a \\mid x)\\,\\big(m - c(a)\\big) \\;-\\; \\hat{p}(\\varnothing \\mid x)\\,m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΠ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}(a\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的转化概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是本单贡献毛利（售价减商品成本、履约与支付手续费），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是激励的直接成本。这个式子解释了为什么「高弃购率类目就该给大折扣」是错的：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p(\\varnothing\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本来就高，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的增量都趋近于零，折扣纯粹是白送。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EV[弃购事件 + 画像] --&gt; FEAT[特征层&lt;br/&gt;实时会话 / 历史 / 价值 / 库存]&#10;  FEAT --&gt; CAND[候选生成&lt;br/&gt;召回动作与商品]&#10;  CAND --&gt; RANK[排序&lt;br/&gt;增量利润打分]&#10;  RANK --&gt; CONS[约束层&lt;br/&gt;预算节流 / 频次]&#10;  CONS --&gt; DEC{决策}&#10;  DEC --&gt;|通过| OFF[下发优惠或内容]&#10;  DEC --&gt;|降级| FALL[回退到无激励提醒]&#10;  OFF --&gt; FB[结果回写&lt;br/&gt;曝光 / 转化 / 核销]&#10;  FB --&gt; LEARN[模型与预算更新]&#10;  LEARN --&gt; RANK\">flowchart TD\n  EV[弃购事件 + 画像] --&gt; FEAT[特征层&lt;br/&gt;实时会话 / 历史 / 价值 / 库存]\n  FEAT --&gt; CAND[候选生成&lt;br/&gt;召回动作与商品]\n  CAND --&gt; RANK[排序&lt;br/&gt;增量利润打分]\n  RANK --&gt; CONS[约束层&lt;br/&gt;预算节流 / 频次]\n  CONS --&gt; DEC{决策}\n  DEC --&gt;|通过| OFF[下发优惠或内容]\n  DEC --&gt;|降级| FALL[回退到无激励提醒]\n  OFF --&gt; FB[结果回写&lt;br/&gt;曝光 / 转化 / 核销]\n  FB --&gt; LEARN[模型与预算更新]\n  LEARN --&gt; RANK</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>固定阶梯</th>\n<th>动态决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>划档依据</td>\n<td>旅程第几步</td>\n<td>用户上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化目标</td>\n<td>打开率 / 点击率</td>\n<td>增量利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΠ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无激励路径</td>\n<td>无（必然给券）</td>\n<td>可被选中的动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算控制</td>\n<td>事后看报表</td>\n<td>在线节流，硬约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>利润稀释、训练用户等券</td>\n<td>过度个性化、可解释性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信号层-哪些输入真正决定优惠决策\">信号层：哪些输入真正决定优惠决策</h2><p>决策质量的上限由输入信号决定。信号分四层，<strong>实时性越强的越贵，也越容易在链路上丢失</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>实时会话信号</strong>（延迟 &lt; 1 秒）：本次会话的加购件数、购物车金额、是否已到结算页、是否反复修改地址或支付方式。它来自事件流，其会话聚合与幂等键设计属于同 hub 的<a href=\"../abandonment-detection-event-identity/cart-checkout-event-stream-modeling\">购物车与结算事件流建模</a>的范畴，此处只消费其结果。</p>\n<p><strong>画像与历史信号</strong>（小时级）：历史订单数、客单价分布、优惠券核销率与<strong>折扣敏感度</strong>、退货率、会员等级、近期是否已有未核销券。折扣敏感度是关键特征：一个「只在有券时下单」的用户，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p(\\varnothing\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显著低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p(15\\%\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，增量是真实的；而一个「原价也照买」的用户两者接近，折扣只是转移了利润。</p>\n<p><strong>商业信号</strong>（秒级到分钟级）：库存深度、季节性清仓、品类毛利结构、履约成本与偏远地区运费。同一个「免运费」对本国订单与跨洋订单的成本可能相差十倍以上，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>免运费</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(\\text{免运费})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免运费</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须是<strong>订单级动态值</strong>。<strong>治理信号</strong>（即时）包括促销定价披露要求、订阅类规则、同意状态与静默时段，它不进入打分函数，而作为<strong>硬约束</strong>在决策之后过滤。</p>\n<p>工程上最重要的一条：<strong>特征缺失不能导致默认给出更大优惠</strong>。缺失回退依次是：实时会话用最近一次快照并标记 <code>stale</code>，画像历史用人群分层均值，商业取保守值只允许无激励动作，治理默认不可发触达。回退必须是「更保守」而非「更宽松」，否则上游一次特征抖动就会让全局折扣率飙升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选生成与排序-从千万商品到三个推荐位\">候选生成与排序：从千万商品到三个推荐位</h2><p>跨境商城 SKU 数常在十万级，不可能对每个商品打分，因此采用两段式：<strong>召回</strong>把候选压到几百个，<strong>排序</strong>用重模型精算。Google 的推荐系统课程把这一结构拆为 retrieval、scoring、re-ranking 三段（来源：Google, Machine Learning Recommendation 课程, <code>developers.google.com/machine-learning/recommendation</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>召回层</strong>用双塔（two-tower）：物品塔离线算好商品向量，用户塔在线用实时特征算用户向量，做近似最近邻检索。对挽回场景，用户塔的输入应包含<strong>本次被弃购物车的商品向量</strong>——「和你刚看的这双鞋相似且更便宜」直接回应了弃购原因中的价格顾虑，比「热门商品」有效得多。<strong>排序层</strong>用梯度提升树（GBDT）或深度模型，特征含用户-物品交叉、价格差、库存、评价分、履约时效。在激励决策里，排序不只排商品，还要排<strong>是否附带激励</strong>：同一件商品打两个分——「原价推荐」与「带 10% 折扣推荐」，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΠ</span></span></span></span></span> 更优者。<strong>重排层</strong>负责多样性（同品牌不超过 2 个、剔除已在购物车中的同款）与频次合规过滤。一个被低估的细节是<strong>推荐内容与优惠必须同源</strong>：排序选中「低价替代品」而优惠给「本商品 10% 折扣」，用户收到的是自相矛盾的信息；正确做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 中每个动作绑定一个商品集合，一起打分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优惠决策算法-上下文老虎机与探索约束\">优惠决策算法：上下文老虎机与探索约束</h2><p>优惠决策本质是**上下文老虎机（contextual bandit）**问题：每轮观察上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，选择动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，得到回报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（增量利润），目标是长期累积回报最大。用监督学习直接拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(a\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 会失败，因为它只学到历史策略产生的数据（日志偏差）——历史上只发过 10% 折扣，模型就永远学不到 5% 的效果。</p>\n<p>工业平台普遍采用汤普森采样（Thompson Sampling）或 UCB 家族。Adobe Target 的 Automated Personalization 与 Auto-Target 用随机森林预测每个体验的转化概率或预估收入，对每个访客服务预测最优的那个；同时用多臂老虎机把一小部分流量持续分给探索，避免模型被过期趋势锁死，并在无法识别个性化赢家时用汤普森采样回退到整体最优体验（来源：Adobe Experience League, Automated Personalization 文档, <code>experienceleague.adobe.com</code>）。可迁移的工程约束是：<strong>一次会话内体验固定不变，会话结束后才可能更换</strong>——否则价格反复跳动，体验与合规都不可接受。</p>\n<p>线性 UCB 形式直观地表达了「利用 + 探索」的权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t = \\arg\\max_{a \\in \\mathcal{A}} \\left( x_t^\\top \\hat{\\theta}_a + \\alpha \\sqrt{ x_t^\\top A_a^{-1} x_t } \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3258em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2858em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5142em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是对期望回报的点估计，第二项是与上下文方向上不确定性成正比的探索奖励。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越激进探索；生产上<strong>探索预算单独隔离</strong>，按月总预算的固定比例（常见 5%–15%）供给，剩余预算由速率上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 节流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与内容约束-促销定价披露-负选项与同意\">合规与内容约束：促销定价披露、负选项与同意</h2><p>个性化的最硬约束不是技术，而是<strong>促销定价的披露义务</strong>。欧盟《价格标示指令》(Directive 98/6/EC) 经《综合指令》(Directive (EU) 2019/2161) 新增的第 6a 条要求：<strong>任何降价公告都必须标示「先前价格」</strong>，且该先前价格是降价前<strong>不少于 30 天</strong>期间内该商品曾适用的<strong>最低价</strong>；易腐或短保质期商品、上架不足 30 天的商品、以及渐进式折扣可例外（来源：EUR-Lex, Directive 98/6/EC 合并版本 28/05/2022, <code>eur-lex.europa.eu</code>）。直接后果是：<strong>不能为制造折扣感而短期抬高「原价」再打折</strong>，引擎的划线价字段应取历史最低价记录。</p>\n<p>订阅类（负选项，negative option）优惠是第二个雷区。美国 FTC 于 <strong>2024 年 10 月 16 日</strong>公布「Click-to-Cancel」最终规则，修订 16 CFR Part 425；随后经历行业诉讼与 2024 年 12 月 13 日的中止审查驳回，到 <strong>2026 年 2 月 12 日</strong>联邦公报发布修订通告、<strong>2026 年 3 月 11 日</strong> FTC 又就拟议规则制定发布征询意见的预告（ANPRM），重新回到规则制定程序（来源：FTC, Negative Option Rule 规则页, <code>ftc.gov</code>）。结论是：<strong>把「取消路径与订阅路径同等便捷」当作默认设计</strong>，不依赖某条具体规则的生效状态。同意与频率是第三类约束：触达必须有明确同意基础，撤回必须立即全渠道生效。Klaviyo 的 2025 年消费者报告称 <strong>50%</strong> 的消费者在获得补偿后愿意给品牌第二次机会，<strong>37%</strong> 在过去六个月内因经济环境主动寻找折扣（来源：Klaviyo Blog, Abandoned Cart Email, 2025-04-28, <code>klaviyo.com/blog/abandoned-cart-email</code>）——这是意愿数据，不是折扣面额的依据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类别</th>\n<th>代表法规/规则</th>\n<th>对决策引擎的要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>促销定价披露</td>\n<td>EU 98/6/EC 第 6a 条（经 2019/2161 修订）</td>\n<td>划线价取 30 天最低价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负选项/订阅</td>\n<td>US FTC 16 CFR Part 425（2024 最终规则，2026 重启程序）</td>\n<td>取消与订阅同等便捷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同意与退订</td>\n<td>GDPR / PECR 等</td>\n<td>同意作硬过滤器，撤回即时生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频次与静默</td>\n<td>平台政策与自律</td>\n<td>单位时间触达上限，全局计数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决策服务的工程实现与降级策略\">决策服务的工程实现与降级策略</h2><p>决策在<strong>在线请求路径</strong>上完成，只有约 100 毫秒的延迟预算。可行架构是：特征在事件流处理时预计算写入低延迟特征存储，决策服务只做特征拼接与模型打分。幂等同样关键——同一订单的<strong>同一次决策请求</strong>必须返回同一动作，否则消息重试会让用户先收到 10% 后变成 15%；以 <code>(profile_id, journey_run_id, step_id)</code> 为决策键缓存结果，并附 <code>decision_id</code> 供归因。</p>\n<p>降级必须逐级更保守：特征超时 → 用上次快照 + 人群分层兜底，<strong>不允许</strong>直接给最大优惠；模型不可用 → 回退保守阶梯；预算服务不可用 → 冻结有偿动作；合规服务不可用 → 默认拒绝触达（fail-closed）。服务还应输出结构化决策日志（决策键、选中动作、打分分解、被哪条约束拦下）——缺少它，模型退化与预算失控只能事后从转化报表反推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>优惠是<strong>决策变量</strong>，优化目标是扣掉基线后的增量利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ΔΠ</span></span></span></span></span>；动作空间必须包含「不给激励」，否则引擎必然过度发券。</li>\n<li>信号分实时会话、画像历史、商业、治理四层，<strong>缺失时的回退必须更保守</strong>。候选生成用双塔召回 + 树模型排序 + 业务重排，推荐内容与优惠面额必须同源一致。</li>\n<li>优惠选择是上下文老虎机问题；汤普森采样与 UCB 处理探索-利用权衡，探索预算需单独隔离。</li>\n<li>合规是硬约束而非打分项：EU 第 6a 条要求降价标示 30 天最低价；FTC 负选项规则在 2024–2026 间经历了制定、诉讼与重启程序。工程上要用决策键保证幂等与可归因，并定义逐级更保守的降级路径——特征是 fail-soft，合规是 fail-closed。</li>\n<li>尚未回答的是<strong>长期效应</strong>：动态折扣是否在降低用户未来原价购买的概率。最小准备是把每次动作与 <code>decision_id</code> 持久化。旅程状态机如何重求守卫，见同 hub 的<a href=\"../recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/journey-state-machine-exit-conditions\">挽回旅程状态机与进入/退出/冷却条件</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态优惠与个性化内容/商品推荐决策","id":"动态优惠与个性化内容-商品推荐决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把优惠视为决策变量而非内容模板","id":"核心概念-把优惠视为决策变量而非内容模板"},{"level":2,"text":"信号层：哪些输入真正决定优惠决策","id":"信号层-哪些输入真正决定优惠决策"},{"level":2,"text":"候选生成与排序：从千万商品到三个推荐位","id":"候选生成与排序-从千万商品到三个推荐位"},{"level":2,"text":"优惠决策算法：上下文老虎机与探索约束","id":"优惠决策算法-上下文老虎机与探索约束"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与内容约束：促销定价披露、负选项与同意","id":"合规与内容约束-促销定价披露-负选项与同意"},{"level":2,"text":"决策服务的工程实现与降级策略","id":"决策服务的工程实现与降级策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"激励类型与折扣弹性/毛利约束决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/incentive-content-decision/incentive-elasticity-margin-framework"},"next":{"title":"激励羊毛防控与预算护栏异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/incentive-content-decision/incentive-abuse-budget-guardrail"}}